# Mixed-type addition: Int + Float returns Float
# The + builtin uses the Add MPTC class via its TypeScheme; this test verifies
# that calling + with Int and Float arguments correctly infers Float return type.
# (MPTC keyed-form constraint annotation e.g. [c: [Add a b]] is future work.)
[
  add-mixed: [fn [x@Int y@Float] [+ x y]]
  result: [add-mixed 1 2.0]
]

---

%.result
=== out
Float(3)
